{"code":"047080","name":"한빛소프트","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"게임엔터테인먼트","sector_desc":"게임 개발·퍼블리싱. 신작 흥행 여부에 따라 실적과 주가가 크게 갈립니다.","desc":"동사는 1999년 게임소프트웨어 개발 및 판매를 위해 설립되었고, 2002년 코스닥시장에 상장했음. 한빛온을 통해 '오디션', '그라나도 에스파다' 등의 온라인 및 모바일게임을 제공하며, 한빛드론은 DJI 공식 파트너로 드론을 유통하고 있음. 2024년 국내 '그라나도 에스파다 M' 출시 후 2025년 대만·일본 서비스를 계획하고, AI 음성 아바타 등 사업을 준비하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-26","n_days":298,"close":1067.0,"open":1068.0,"high":1094.0,"low":1031.0,"volume":34166,"amount":36455122.0,"ret_1d":-2.8233,"gap":-2.7322,"range_pct":5.9044,"ret_5":-1.2037,"ret_20":0.6604,"ret_60":7.0211,"ret_120":-18.2375,"ret_250":-17.2868,"ma20":1072.7,"ma60":1037.3833,"ma120":1145.7917,"ma200":1180.51,"close_vs_ma200":-9.6153,"close_vs_ma60":2.8549,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":74.2776,"r2_60":0.4021,"slope_120":-50.3163,"r2_120":0.4215,"slope_250":-15.6616,"r2_250":0.1864,"high52":1942.0,"low52":823.0,"pos_52w":21.8052,"dd_52w":-45.0566,"mdd_1y":-47.8415,"atr14_pct":5.9981,"vol_ann_60":46.2984,"vol_avg20":57780.35,"vol_ratio20":0.5913,"vr5":0.658,"vr20":0.1499,"amount_avg5":67156289.4,"amount_avg20":62215654.95,"amount_avg60":89354802.85,"obv_chg20":23.1927,"turnover_20":4.6555,"pv_eff_20":0.1418,"rsi14":49.0571,"frgn_net_5":15614.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.0629,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0629,"frgn_net_20":51609.0,"inst_net_20":0.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":0.2079,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0,"smart_net_20_pct":0.2079,"frgn_net_60":167327.0,"inst_net_60":-19971.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":0.6741,"inst_net_60_pct":-0.0805,"smart_net_60_pct":0.5936,"frgn_net_120":59002.0,"inst_net_120":-5291.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":0.2377,"inst_net_120_pct":-0.0213,"smart_net_120_pct":0.2164,"foreign_ratio":4.03,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":0.33,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":6.0,"op_margin_q":8.8235,"op_qoq":-72.7273,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":0.0,"rev_yoy":-42.8571,"op_trend_4q":44.8485,"fin_period":"202606","roe":45.21,"debt_ratio":18.2,"per":3.4,"pbr":1.25,"div_yield":null,"foreign_rate":4.